2026-09-23T07:59:13.3942660Z     
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3942739Z     
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3943509Z     Thanks to ``pytest``'s detailed assertion introspection, you can simply use plain ``assert`` statements. See `getting-started <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/getting-started.html#our-first-test-run>`_ for more examples.
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3943585Z     
