2026-09-23T07:59:13.3943752Z     Features
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3943835Z     --------
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3943914Z     
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3944406Z     - Detailed info on failing `assert statements <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/assert.html>`_ (no need to remember ``self.assert*`` names)
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3944486Z     
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3944575Z     - `Auto-discovery
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3944876Z       <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/goodpractices.html#python-test-discovery>`_
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3944982Z       of test modules and functions
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3945062Z     
2026-09-23T07:59:13.3945341Z     - `Modular fixtures <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/fixtures.html>`_ for
